msgid "Post-processing of output and databases"
msgstr "输出与数据库的后处理"

msgid "Output"
msgstr "输出"

msgid ""
"Molpro produces an output file that is in XML format with appropriate mark-"
"up for all important results. This file, which has a ``.xml`` suffix, "
"conforms strictly to a `well-defined schema "
"<https://www.molpro.net/schema/molpro-output.xsd>`__, and the the schema "
"definition file can be found in the main Molpro source or installation tree "
"in the directory ``lib/schema``. The principal elements of marked-up output "
"are"
msgstr ""
"Molpro 会生成一个 XML 格式的输出文件，其中对所有重要结果都进行了适当的标记。该文件具有 ``.xml`` 后缀，严格遵循一个\\ "
"`定义良好的模式 <https://www.molpro.net/schema/molpro-output.xsd>`__\\ "
"，并且该模式定义文件可以在主 Molpro 源代码或安装目录的 ``lib/schema`` 目录中找到。标记输出的主要元素包括"

msgid "**jobstep** The results from one job step."
msgstr "**jobstep** 一个作业步骤的结果。"

msgid "**molecule** A container for data on a single molecule."
msgstr "**molecule** 单个分子数据的容器。"

msgid ""
"**cml:molecule** Molecular geometry in the Chemical Markup Language (CML) "
"format."
msgstr "**cml:molecule** 化学标记语言 (CML) 格式的分子几何结构。"

msgid ""
"**property** A computed property, for example an energy or dipole moment."
msgstr "**property** 一个计算得到的性质，例如能量或偶极矩。"

msgid "**table** The output of Molpro’s ``TABLE`` command in XHTML format."
msgstr "**table** Molpro 的 ``TABLE`` 命令以 XHTML 格式输出的内容。"

msgid "**basisSet** A self-contained description of the orbital basis set."
msgstr "**basisSet** 轨道基组的自包含描述。"

msgid "**orbitals** A set of orbitals."
msgstr "**orbitals** 一组轨道。"

msgid "**vibrations** Harmonic normal vibrational modes."
msgstr "**vibrations** 简谐正则振动模式。"

msgid "**variables** Molpro’s internal variables."
msgstr "**variables** Molpro 的内部变量。"

msgid ""
"**platform** Information about the computing system on which a job was run."
msgstr "**platform** 关于运行作业的计算系统的信息。"

msgid ""
"Not all of these elements are produced by default in the regular job "
"transcript ``.xml`` file; some of them can result from using the ``PUT,XML``"
" to make a separate dump file."
msgstr ""
"并非所有这些元素都会默认在常规作业记录 ``.xml`` 文件中生成；其中一些可能源自使用 ``PUT,XML`` 命令生成单独的转储文件。"

msgid ""
"``molpro-output`` is understood by several post-processing programs, "
"including `Jmol <https://jmol.org>`__, `sjef "
"<https://github.com/molpro/sjef>`__, `iMolpro "
"<https://github.com/molpro/iMolpro>`__, and gmolpro. There is extensive "
"support for it in the `pymolpro <https://github.com/molpro/pymolpro>`__ "
"library, which should be the normal route for accessing data. Pymolpro is "
"available on `conda forge <https://conda-forge.org/>`__, and some examples "
"of its use can be found `here "
"<https://molpro.github.io/pymolpro/examples.html>`__."
msgstr ""
"``molpro-output`` 可被多个后处理程序理解，包括 `Jmol <https://jmol.org>`__\\ 、\\ `sjef "
"<https://github.com/molpro/sjef>`__\\ 、\\ `iMolpro "
"<https://github.com/molpro/iMolpro>`__ 和 gmolpro。\\ `pymolpro "
"<https://github.com/molpro/pymolpro>`__ 库对其提供了广泛支持，这应是访问数据的常规途径。Pymolpro 可在 "
"`conda forge <https://conda-forge.org/>`__ 上获取，其使用示例可在此处 `找到 "
"<https://molpro.github.io/pymolpro/examples.html>`__\\ 。"

msgid "Databases"
msgstr "数据库"
